      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹2.49 loss per share (down from ₹4.10 profit in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.13b (down 2.1% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹126.1m (down 161% from profit in 3Q 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 16%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 45% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Pharmaceuticals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 18% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
